# Skill surface

**Domain shift** (new service, tool surface, operational domain) ⇒ scan `<available_skills>` by description and
load matched description-gated rules **before** advising or acting; follow skills as `Use the <slug> skill`
(do not fs-read skill SOT into context).

**Cursor owns sync.** `edit(cursor-plugins/ulg-ecosystem/{skills,commands,rules} ∨ census) ⇒ run
scripts/cursor/install-ecosystem-plugin.sh ∧ verify ~/.cursor/plugins/local/ulg-ecosystem matches SoT` same
turn; Claude-slug bodies (`shared_sync` / uploadable `life_local`) additionally regen + upload + verify.
Installed trees are copies — Reload Window is not install. `¬ ask(operator, install ∨ upload ∨ "sync the plugin")`;
`¬ claim live` before the install/upload ran this session. `cursor_only` never uploads.

Census slugs live in the plugin tree only — never re-add under `{repo}/.cursor/skills` or `.claude/skills`.
Runbook: Use the `claude-ai-bundle-sync` skill · doctrine `decision:claude-ai-skill-upload-automation` ·
placement `cursor-rule-placement_ulg`.
